    <apiVersion>62.0</apiVersion>
    <description>Triage Cockpit C5: for Contact-linked PFCs at existing accounts — @mentions the Account Owner on the record feed and creates a review Task for them. Visible only when Contact__c is set (page-level action visibility).</description>
